<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδᾰγωγ-ός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδὸς ἀγωγός</span>
			, <i>slave who went with a boy from home to school and back
				again</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				725
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>El.</u>
				287
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				3.3.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				32.28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ly.</u>
				208c
			</span></i>: coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίτθη,
			τροφός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				373c
			</span></i>; with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡγεμών</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				467d
			</span></i>; with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διδάσκαλος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>; of Phoenix, as the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.</span> of
			Achilles, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				390e
			</span></i>, etc.; Fabius is called the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.</span> of Hannibal, <i>because he always followed him
			about</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				5
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ νόμος π. εἰς Χριστόν</span>
			<i>has guided us</i> until attainment of faith in Christ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Gal.</u>
				3.24
			</span></i>: generally, <i>leader</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημοκρατίας, τυραννίδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Arat.</u>
				48
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Galb.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
